e_name": "05_Faces_Selector_2560x1440.png", "id": "1288337783335827", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_1288337786669160_4475558771986816353_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=69ZjV7CUangQ7kNvwEamA7F&_nc_oc=Adr4weZuOh7qtvqPVZ2AAc6jV91IxZm7mMXvnE9hYkA7ez3mzSU9BT1OQs5ztPlKhW0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMsXXHJ8nQHjARhSLWBHbZSzhdV-Lzyc68-yrSHq_jhjA&oe=6ACBC2ED"}, {"file_name": "01_Barker_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "1821110108888468", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830441_1821110112221801_8561623093088699699_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=03Kg20dREe0Q7kNvwGT2tOh&_nc_oc=AdqGCLLKKQpTOB63DmPTTSoxIXjYsa1hFK6RQW9dL_-xPlX-5CMFPtD812-u3OAozRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO3s2WrqaWrKDKZtD360H0JV9cbc6xuIGpvOJjRIz_O6w&oe=6ACBB94F"}, {"file_name": "03_Barker_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2620587385039026", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585799753_2620587388372359_8557321908904764527_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SDECD5KuLewQ7kNvwH9rsZh&_nc_oc=AdrzinrSCwd4qQ9U5kJML2DtupdDHOKoMVgNzJZGXge8_ibQyzEsSPL0KkH0yytLmZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMZ1l2DX2aSNb-6IJdGnR50Sh3CLY2vlpoA1-2kOWNI1g&oe=6ACBBCFC"}, {"file_name": "02_Flexer_Neutral_2560x1440.png", "id": "3167831576755462", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_3167831580088795_7645227145100028470_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pBBOBHY2g0wQ7kNvwH0BhZ3&_nc_oc=AdogDsznkBaSPyx0mnIsQ75wf2gZSDmi0oPjjZ9yjXq0uFFgWjh2fa6eHQWeisTWHX8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM45bCocdaazSy28Xa87IuxjbbdEbDozDMminFchw127Q&oe=6ACB8ECC"}, {"file_name": "04_Flexer_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2184872072072152", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_2184872075405485_4008272742366392584_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zzpmaZbS0pkQ7kNvwGyci9Z&_nc_oc=AdrbEiALVKLUrfMyQm-wtnHTzOILegvhZNPJVo1QplclCXAU2dv5jUVMu3Fy-_XlNX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNbjh2C054AIln7wN-JPA7ih-Xp3fd94aJWVzgo-hlfrw&oe=6ACBB813"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punchable Face", "keywords": ["boxing", "punching", "arcade", "stress", "fitness"], "long_description": "Sometimes you just want to punch a face.\n\n**Punchable Face** is a simple VR stress toy built around one idea: choose an irritating character, step into their world, and go to town.\n\n## Choose Your Face\n\n### The Barker\nA grinning carnival loudmouth waiting for you under the lights.\n\n### The Flexer\nA smug car-meet regular surrounded by modified cars and nighttime parking-lot lights.\n\n## Hit Harder\n\nEvery valid punch is measured using your controller speed and converted into an **Impact Score from 100 to 999**.\n\nChase your Session Best and watch each character react with movement, haptics, impact audio, facial reactions, and accumulating redness that slowly fades when you stop.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two characters with unique environments\n- Physics-based punch detection\n- Impact Score and Session Best\n- Hand-specific haptics\n- Reactive faces and visual feedback\n- Standing or seated play\n- No locomotion, rounds, health bars, or complicated progression\n\n**Pick a face. Punch it.**", "short_description": "Pick an annoying face, put on your gloves, and start swinging. Punchable Face is a simple VR stress toy with satisfying impacts, haptics, scoring, and two ridiculous characters to pummel."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/privacy-policy/punchable-face", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "StormXR LLC", "support_website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/contact", "website_url": "https://www.stormxr.tech/development", "category": n